<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no"><title>2026 国庆山西家庭旅行手册｜图文版</title><style>
:root{
  --paper:#f5f1e9;--sheet:#fffdf8;--ink:#282724;--muted:#716b62;--line:#ded6c9;
  --rust:#8d4738;--jade:#4f6b60;--sand:#eee7dc;--soft:#f8f4ed;--gold:#95753c;--landscape-sprite:url("assets/curated/landscape-sprite.webp");--portrait-sprite:url("assets/curated/portrait-sprite.webp");
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;background:var(--paper);-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{margin:0;color:var(--ink);font-family:"Microsoft YaHei","PingFang SC","Noto Sans CJK SC",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;background:var(--paper)}
a{color:var(--rust);text-decoration:none}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.topbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:30;height:50px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding:0 max(24px,calc((100vw - 1180px)/2));background:rgba(247,243,236,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}
.topbar b{margin-right:auto;font-weight:650}.topbar a{color:#615b53}
.hero{position:relative;min-height:620px;background-color:#272421;background-image:var(--landscape-sprite);background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:200% auto;background-position:0% 50%;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:flex-end}
.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(18,16,14,.08) 15%,rgba(18,16,14,.22) 48%,rgba(18,16,14,.82) 100%)}
.hero-inner{position:relative;width:min(1180px,92vw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 0 62px}
.hero .eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.16em;opacity:.85}.hero h1{font-family:"Songti SC","Noto Serif CJK SC",serif;font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,72px);line-height:1.08;margin:10px 0 14px;font-weight:700}.hero p{font-size:18px;max-width:820px;margin:0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.92)}
.hero-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;margin-top:22px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.84)}
main{width:min(1180px,92vw);margin:0 auto 90px}.section{padding:68px 0 0}.section-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:28px}.section-no{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--rust);padding-top:8px}.section h2{font-family:"Songti SC","Noto Serif CJK SC",serif;font-size:34px;line-height:1.25;margin:0}.section-intro{font-size:17px;color:#4e4a45;max-width:900px;margin:10px 0 0}
.summary-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.summary-card{border-top:2px solid var(--rust);background:rgba(255,253,248,.76);padding:17px 18px;min-height:112px}.summary-card b{display:block;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:5px}.summary-card span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.route-line{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;align-items:center;margin-top:24px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}.route-line span{white-space:nowrap}.route-line i{font-style:normal;color:#aaa198}
.weather-shell{border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,253,248,.55);padding:0 18px;margin-bottom:22px}.trip-weather-header{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;align-items:center;min-height:38px;padding:9px 0 7px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.trip-weather-grid-head,.trip-weather-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,1.55fr) minmax(90px,.7fr) 100px minmax(190px,1fr);gap:14px;align-items:center}.trip-weather-grid-head{padding:0 0 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.trip-weather-row{min-height:50px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}.trip-weather-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}.trip-weather-primary{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline}.trip-weather-date,.trip-weather-temperature{white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.trip-weather-condition{font-weight:600}.trip-weather-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr;gap:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.trip-weather-precipitation,.trip-weather-wind{white-space:nowrap}.trip-weather-fallback{padding:13px 0;margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.region-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.region{background:var(--sheet);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px}.region h3{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 6px}.region p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.packing{margin-top:16px;padding:15px 18px;border-left:3px solid var(--jade);background:#f2f5f2;font-size:14px}
.day{background:var(--sheet);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:26px 28px;margin:20px 0;box-shadow:0 5px 18px rgba(55,43,29,.045)}.day-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:88px 1fr auto;gap:18px;align-items:start;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:18px}.datebox{background:#2f302d;color:white;border-radius:11px;padding:10px 8px;text-align:center}.datebox b{display:block;font-size:22px;line-height:1.15}.datebox span{display:block;font-size:11px;opacity:.75;margin-top:4px}.day h3{font-family:"Songti SC","Noto Serif CJK SC",serif;font-size:26px;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 3px}.day-sub{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.status{font-size:12px;color:var(--rust);border:1px solid #d9c8be;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 9px;white-space:nowrap}.day-columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:28px;align-items:start}.day-block h4{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--rust);margin:0 0 6px}.day-block ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.15em}.day-block li{margin:5px 0}.info-stack{display:grid;gap:10px}.info-card{background:var(--soft);border-left:3px solid var(--jade);padding:11px 13px;font-size:13.5px}.info-card b{display:block;color:#385549;margin-bottom:2px}.info-card.warn{border-color:var(--gold);background:#fbf7ee}.info-card.warn b{color:#7a602b}
.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:20px}.gallery.one{grid-template-columns:1fr}.gallery.three{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.gallery figure{margin:0;background:#eee8df;border-radius:13px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #ded5c9}.gallery img{display:block;width:100%;height:330px;object-fit:cover}.gallery .portrait img{object-position:center 42%}.gallery figcaption{padding:8px 11px;background:#fff;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.link-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:14px}.text-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;border-bottom:1px solid #cdbeb4;padding:2px 0;font-size:13px}.text-link:after{content:"↗";font-size:11px}
.hotel-grid,.food-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.hotel,.food{background:var(--sheet);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:17px 18px}.hotel h3,.food h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 4px}.meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:9px}.tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:10px 0}.tag{font-size:11px;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:999px;background:#f1ece4;color:#625b51}.hotel p,.food p{font-size:13.5px;margin:7px 0;color:#494641}
.food-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:24px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px;background:var(--sheet);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}.food-hero .tile{height:360px;aspect-ratio:auto}.food-hero-copy{padding:22px 26px 22px 0}.food-hero-copy h3{font-family:"Songti SC","Noto Serif CJK SC",serif;font-size:26px;margin:0 0 8px}.food-hero-copy p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:7px 0}
.food-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:18px;background:var(--sheet);font-size:13px}.food-table th,.food-table td{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 11px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}.food-table th{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);background:#f2ede5}.food-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
.drive-grid,.check-grid,.quick-links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.plain-card{background:var(--sheet);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 17px}.plain-card h3{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 6px}.plain-card p,.plain-card li{font-size:13.5px;color:#4f4b45}.plain-card ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.1em}
.quick-links{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.quick-link{display:block;background:var(--sheet);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:14px 15px;color:var(--ink);min-height:86px}.quick-link b{display:block;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:4px}.quick-link span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.quick-link:hover{text-decoration:none;border-color:#c6b8aa}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:70px;padding:24px 0 40px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}

.tile{width:100%;display:block;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-color:#eee8df}
.tile.portrait{aspect-ratio:4/5;background-image:var(--portrait-sprite);background-size:400% 200%}
.tile.landscape{aspect-ratio:3/2;background-image:var(--landscape-sprite);background-size:200% 100%}
.p1{background-position:0% 0%}.p2{background-position:33.333% 0%}.p3{background-position:66.667% 0%}.p4{background-position:100% 0%}
.p5{background-position:0% 100%}.p6{background-position:33.333% 100%}.p7{background-position:66.667% 100%}.p8{background-position:100% 100%}
.l2{background-position:100% 50%}
@media(max-width:900px){.summary-grid,.region-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.quick-links{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.gallery.three{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media(max-width:760px){body{font-size:15px}.topbar{height:46px;padding:0 16px;gap:16px;overflow-x:auto;white-space:nowrap}.topbar b{display:none}.hero{min-height:52vh}.hero-inner{width:90vw;padding-bottom:32px}.hero h1{font-size:40px}.hero p{font-size:15px}.hero-meta{gap:8px 14px}.section{padding-top:46px}.section-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1px;margin-bottom:20px}.section-no{padding-top:0}.section h2{font-size:28px}.section-intro{font-size:15px}.summary-grid,.region-grid,.hotel-grid,.food-grid,.drive-grid,.check-grid,.quick-links{grid-template-columns:1fr}.summary-card{min-height:0}.trip-weather-grid-head{display:none}.weather-shell{padding:0 12px}.trip-weather-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;grid-template-areas:"primary temperature" "condition meta";gap:3px 10px;padding:10px 0}.trip-weather-primary{grid-area:primary}.trip-weather-condition{grid-area:condition;font-weight:500}.trip-weather-temperature{grid-area:temperature}.trip-weather-meta{grid-area:meta;display:flex;gap:7px;justify-content:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap}.day{padding:18px 16px;border-radius:13px}.day-head{grid-template-columns:66px 1fr;gap:11px}.status{grid-column:2;justify-self:start}.datebox b{font-size:19px}.day h3{font-size:21px}.day-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}.gallery,.gallery.three{grid-template-columns:1fr}.gallery img{height:auto;max-height:none;object-fit:contain;background:#eee8df}.food-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.food-hero .tile{height:330px}.food-hero-copy{padding:0 18px 18px}.food-table{display:block;overflow-x:auto;white-space:normal}.food-table table{min-width:620px}}
</style><script defer src="weather.js"></script></head><body>
<nav class="topbar"><b>2026 山西家庭旅行</b><a href="#overview">概览</a><a href="#weather">天气</a><a href="#daily">逐日行程</a><a href="#hotels">住宿</a><a href="#food">餐饮</a><a href="#links">常用链接</a></nav>
<header class="hero"><div class="hero-inner"><div class="eyebrow">SHANXI · 2026 NATIONAL DAY</div><h1>国庆山西家庭旅行手册</h1><p>9月26日—10月5日｜从大同一路向南到运城。前半段以高铁与包车为主，9月30日晚爸爸在太原会合，10月1日起进入自驾段。</p><div class="hero-meta"><span>妈妈 + 奶奶｜9/26—9/30</span><span>爸爸 + 妈妈 + 奶奶｜10/1—10/5</span><span>固定酒店不变</span></div></div></header>
<main>
<section class="section" id="overview"><div class="section-head"><div class="section-no">01 · OVERVIEW</div><div><h2>行程概览</h2><p class="section-intro">这条线的好处是方向很顺：大同看石窟和辽金古建，太原、平遥接上晋中，再一路走到临汾西部、壶口和晋南古建。国庆真正需要留意的是长距离转场和热门景区客流，而不是再往行程里塞更多景点。</p></div></div>
<div class="summary-grid">
<div class="summary-card"><b>9/26—9/28｜大同</b><span>云冈、大同古城、应县与浑源。9/28包车，走一段、坐一段。</span></div>
<div class="summary-card"><b>9/29｜大同 → 忻州</b><span>上午留给华严寺、善化寺、九龙壁，下午转场。</span></div>
<div class="summary-card"><b>9/30｜忻州 → 太原</b><span>白天放慢节奏，爸爸晚间落地太原后会合。</span></div>
<div class="summary-card"><b>10/1｜太原 → 平遥</b><span>晋祠起步，镇国寺、双林寺视路况穿插，夜宿平遥。</span></div>
<div class="summary-card"><b>10/2｜平遥 → 隰县</b><span>王家大院、广胜寺、大槐树同日，遇堵车优先保王家和广胜寺。</span></div>
<div class="summary-card"><b>10/3｜隰县 → 万荣</b><span>小西天、壶口瀑布，再向万荣转场。当天不再额外加点。</span></div>
<div class="summary-card"><b>10/4｜晋南古建</b><span>飞云楼、永乐宫、广仁王庙、解州关帝庙，永乐宫优先级最高。</span></div>
<div class="summary-card"><b>10/5｜运城返程</b><span>早上留足退房和去机场/车站的时间，不安排需要排队的大景点。</span></div>
</div>
<div class="route-line"><span>南京</span><i>→</i><span>大同</span><i>→</i><span>应县 / 浑源</span><i>→</i><span>忻州</span><i>→</i><span>太原</span><i>→</i><span>平遥</span><i>→</i><span>洪洞 / 隰县</span><i>→</i><span>壶口</span><i>→</i><span>万荣 / 芮城</span><i>→</i><span>运城</span></div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="weather"><div class="section-head"><div class="section-no">02 · WEATHER</div><div><h2>天气与体感</h2><p class="section-intro">山西这一程南北跨度不小。大同、浑源早晚会明显偏凉，壶口又有风和水雾；到了运城整体会温和一些。衣服按分层穿最省事。</p></div></div>
<div class="weather-shell trip-weather" data-trip-weather><div class="trip-weather-header"><span data-trip-weather-updated></span><span data-trip-weather-status>正在更新天气…</span></div><div class="trip-weather-grid-head"><span>日期 / 行程地</span><span>天气</span><span>温度</span><span>降水 / 风</span></div><div data-trip-weather-list role="list"><p class="trip-weather-fallback">天气正在加载</p></div></div>
<div class="region-grid">
<div class="region"><h3>大同 / 应县 / 浑源</h3><p>北段早晚凉，遇风体感会再低一截。薄长袖、针织或抓绒、轻防风外套最好都带着。</p></div>
<div class="region"><h3>太原 / 平遥</h3><p>白天通常舒服，夜里古城散步会凉。中午可以减一层，晚上再把外套穿回来。</p></div>
<div class="region"><h3>隰县 / 壶口</h3><p>壶口的水雾和风比气温数字更影响体感。鞋底防滑、外层轻防水会更实用。</p></div>
<div class="region"><h3>万荣 / 芮城 / 运城</h3><p>南段相对暖一些，但仍建议保留薄外套，不必另外带厚重冬装。</p></div>
</div><div class="packing"><b>随手放在外层行李：</b>轻外套、一次性雨衣、纸巾、保温杯、常用药、充电宝。奶奶另外多带一件保暖中层，早晚直接加上。</div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="daily"><div class="section-head"><div class="section-no">03 · DAY BY DAY</div><div><h2>逐日行程</h2><p class="section-intro">每天按交通、景点、吃饭和住宿展开。时间保留弹性，以区间为主，不排成分钟表。</p></div></div>

<article class="day"><div class="day-head"><div class="datebox"><b>9/26</b><span>周六</span></div><div><h3>南京 → 大同｜当天只负责到达</h3><div class="day-sub">G469 南京南 14:23 → 大同南 21:57</div></div><span class="status">转场日</span></div><div class="day-columns"><div class="day-block"><h4>怎么走</h4><ul><li>下午上车前吃一顿正常午饭，车上准备水和少量零食。</li><li>车程较长，中间有机会就起身活动一下；到大同后直接打车去酒店。</li><li>晚到不再安排古城夜游。办理入住、简单吃一点，把精神留给第二天云冈。</li></ul></div><div class="info-stack"><div class="info-card"><b>住</b>玩途·代王邻里（大同古城店），连续住三晚，后两天逛古城会很方便。</div><div class="info-card warn"><b>晚间</b>大同夜里比南京凉得快，外套放在随身可拿的位置，不要压在箱底。</div></div></div><div class="link-row"><a class="text-link" href="https://hotels.ctrip.com/hotels/133206789.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">大同酒店页面</a></div></article>

<article class="day"><div class="day-head"><div class="datebox"><b>9/27</b><span>周日</span></div><div><h3>云冈石窟 → 大同博物馆 → 古城</h3><div class="day-sub">中秋假期末段，云冈预约和客流决定当天节奏</div></div><span class="status">热门景区</span></div><div class="day-columns"><div class="day-block"><h4>当天安排</h4><ul><li>上午把时间完整留给云冈石窟，不和后面的项目抢时间。</li><li>下午回城后去大同博物馆，室内参观也正好让大家坐一坐、缓一缓。</li><li>傍晚回酒店休息。体力够再到古城吃饭散步，代王府、乾楼这类顺路看到即可。</li></ul></div><div class="info-stack"><div class="info-card"><b>吃</b>想吃凤临阁可以先看排号；等位太久就换凯鸽，不用把一个晚上耗在门口。</div><div class="info-card warn"><b>预约</b>云冈采用实名预约，节假日前后尽量提前把票锁定。</div></div></div><div class="link-row"><a class="text-link" href="https://www.dt.gov.cn/dt12345/rxdt1/202604/29b73c0aa08148e3baca536eb7166bb9.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener">云冈石窟预约公告</a><a class="text-link" href="https://gs.ctrip.com/html5/you/foods/Datong275/8639.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">凤临阁点评</a><a class="text-link" href="https://gs.ctrip.com/html5/you/foods/Datong275/8683.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">凯鸽酒楼点评</a></div></article>

<article class="day"><div class="day-head"><div class="datebox"><b>9/28</b><span>周一</span></div><div><h3>应县木塔 → 净土寺 → 悬空寺 → 永安寺 → 圆觉寺</h3><div class="day-sub">包车往返大同，司机负责驾驶，路上可以休息</div></div><span class="status">包车日</span></div><div class="day-columns"><div class="day-block"><h4>怎么排</h4><ul><li>先到应县看木塔和净土寺，再去浑源。两地之间车程正好能让奶奶休息。</li><li>悬空寺先看整体，是否登临到现场再决定；不登临也不影响这一站本身的观赏。</li><li>永安寺值得保留。圆觉寺放在最后，有时间再去，没必要为了它压缩返程。</li><li>午饭尽量在应县或浑源县城解决，不在景点门口等高峰餐位。</li></ul></div><div class="info-stack"><div class="info-card"><b>悬空寺</b>登临票数量有限，妈妈如果想登，最好提前把官方规则和预约入口看一遍。</div><div class="info-card warn"><b>奶奶</b>以山下游览和休息为主，登临不作为必须完成的项目。</div></div></div><div class="gallery"><figure><div class="tile portrait p1" role="img" aria-label="应县木塔"></div><figcaption>应县木塔｜9/28</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="tile landscape l2" role="img" aria-label="悬空寺"></div><figcaption>悬空寺｜9/28</figcaption></figure></div><div class="link-row"><a class="text-link" href="https://www.byhs.net.cn/culture_detial/204.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">悬空寺登临须知</a><a class="text-link" href="https://www.byhs.net.cn/Travel_Guide/1.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">恒山景区票务与摆渡</a></div></article>
